{"id":"cd5770679ac96b38","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-thm-rowbottom.md","title":"Rowbottom Theorem","display":"thm-rowbottom — Rowbottom Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-rowbottom","aliases":["58-thm-rowbottom"],"display":"thm-rowbottom — Rowbottom Theorem","depends_on":["[[58-df-cardinal]]","[[58-df-measurable]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-finite]]","[[58-df-countable]]","[[58-df-equinumerous]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-rowbottom"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-rowbottom</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-rowbottom — Rowbottom Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"109d01fe15884218\" href=\"?note=109d01fe15884218\" title=\"58-df-measurable\">58-df-measurable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"58-df-finite\">58-df-finite</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1b3610e6aed65b25\" href=\"?note=1b3610e6aed65b25\" title=\"58-df-countable\">58-df-countable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"28c79fde9f892bfe\" href=\"?note=28c79fde9f892bfe\" title=\"58-df-equinumerous\">58-df-equinumerous</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,\\lambda,f,H,D\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,\\lambda,f,H,D\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measurable}(\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{Measurable}(\\kappa)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\)</span> are the exact predicates.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function},\\mathrm{Finite},\\mathrm{Countable}_S,\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Function},\\mathrm{Finite},\\mathrm{Countable}_S,\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S\\)</span> are the exact coding predicates.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}rowbottom}\\vdash \\mathrm{Measurable}(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\lambda&lt;\\kappa\\land\\exists D\\in V\\;\\Bigl(D=\\{a\\in\\mathcal P(\\kappa):\\mathrm{Finite}(a)\\}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,D,\\lambda)\\land\\exists H\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S(H,\\kappa)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{Countable}_S(\\{f(a):a\\in D\\land a\\subseteq H\\land\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S(a,n)\\})\\bigr)\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}rowbottom}\\vdash \\mathrm{Measurable}(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\lambda&lt;\\kappa\\land\\exists D\\in V\\;\\Bigl(D=\\{a\\in\\mathcal P(\\kappa):\\mathrm{Finite}(a)\\}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,D,\\lambda)\\land\\exists H\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S(H,\\kappa)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{Countable}_S(\\{f(a):a\\in D\\land a\\subseteq H\\land\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S(a,n)\\})\\bigr)\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The finite-subset domain, homogeneous-size witness, and countable color images are all expressed by registered predicates rather than cardinality-bar notation.</li>\n<li>Merely being a strong-limit cardinal does not imply this partition property.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-measurable","status":"resolved","id":"109d01fe15884218","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-measurable]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-finite","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-finite]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-countable","status":"resolved","id":"1b3610e6aed65b25","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-countable]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-equinumerous","status":"resolved","id":"28c79fde9f892bfe","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-equinumerous]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa,\\lambda,f,H,D\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Measurable}(\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function},\\mathrm{Finite},\\mathrm{Countable}_S,\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}rowbottom}\\vdash \\mathrm{Measurable}(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\lambda<\\kappa\\land\\exists D\\in V\\;\\Bigl(D=\\{a\\in\\mathcal P(\\kappa):\\mathrm{Finite}(a)\\}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,D,\\lambda)\\land\\exists H\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S(H,\\kappa)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{Countable}_S(\\{f(a):a\\in D\\land a\\subseteq H\\land\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S(a,n)\\})\\bigr)\\Bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":1307,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4398","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-thm-rowbottom.md|58-thm-rowbottom]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["5fb1c2241d1943d1","109d01fe15884218","36d7463d215be751","d9a25b0ac94a3598","1b3610e6aed65b25","28c79fde9f892bfe"]}